@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@freeKey = demo-key-free-123
@proKey = demo-key-pro-456
@adminKey = fake-admin-key-123

### Public endpoint: unlimited, counted
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/public

### Valid free key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/data
X-API-Key: {{freeKey}}

### Valid pro key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/data
X-API-Key: {{proKey}}

### Missing key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/data

### Invalid key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/data
X-API-Key: invalid-demo-key

### Monitoring summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring/summary
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Client statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring/clients
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Recent time series
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring/timeseries
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Monitoring rejects a missing admin key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring/summary

### Burst: run this request repeatedly to exhaust the bucket
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/data
X-API-Key: {{freeKey}}

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health